{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:abb2268b080d1f73","name":"Componentization","source":{"id":"source:reference-abb2268b080d1f73","title":"Componentization","revision":21144,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:14:47Z","sha256":"a18c9de27ef277bfc6612219c64f237b718dd69b86bd1d40ab4bbe0afc570963","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21144","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Componentization&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-abb2268b080d1f73","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["COMPONENTIZATION\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["UPGRADE POINT"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/UPGRADE_POINT"}," COST\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Basic\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Deluxe\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Componentization is a process where a single piece of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon"}," is composed of several different pieces, each of which is disguised to appear as another type of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"},", such as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Comlink"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Comlink","referenceId":"reference:609e72c37493843f"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Datapad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Datapad","referenceId":"reference:7a32da74ac188805"},", or even a vibroshaver. Componentization is a common upgrade for assassins, smugglers, and nobles who want to carry ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapons"}," or other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," into a location secretly.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Basic Componentization Upgrade (one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Slot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Slot"},") breaks the item or weapon into two component parts, each one size category smaller than the original item. An item or weapon with the Deluxe Upgrade (two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Slots"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Slots"},") breaks down into four items, each two size categories smaller than the original item. For example, a Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sporting Blaster Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sporting_Blaster_Rifle","referenceId":"reference:71fc5e161a6b812a"}," can break down into two Small objects with the Basic Upgrade or into four Tiny objects with the Deluxe Upgrade. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"}," is required to assemble a Componentized item from two parts. Two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Actions"}," are required to assemble a Componentized item from four parts. Identifying a component as part of this Upgrade package requires a DC 30 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," or DC 25 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Technology)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Technology)"}," check.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
